title: Investigating Domestic Enemies
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs, cabinet
on-arrival: domestic_enemies_timer += 6; month_actions += 1
view-if: psoe_in_government = 1 and interior_minister_party = "PSOE" and domestic_enemies <= 0
card-image: img/ga_casas_viejas.jpg

# TODO: AÑADIR FLAVOUR A LAS DECISIONES ESTAS

= Investigating Domestic Enemies

As we have control over the Gobernación Ministry, we can direct police and intelligence services to investigate internal enemies. We can proscribe various organizations.

- @police: Go to general Ministry of Gobernación actions. 
- @ban_fe: Ban the fascist [+ jons_name +].
- @unban_fe: Unban the [+ jons_name +].
- @persecute_fe
- @ban_rc: Ban the reactionary Comunión Carlista.
- @unban_rc: Unban the Comunión Carlista.
- @persecute_rc
- @ban_pce: Ban the Communist PCE.
- @unban_pce: Unban the PCE.
- @persecute_pce
- @ban_cnt: Ban the Anarchist CNT.
- @unban_cnt: Unban the CNT.
- @persecute_cnt
- @root: Take no action for now.

@ban_fe
view-if: falange_urgency >= 3 and mf_banned == 0 and fe_persecuted >= 1 and primo_detained == 1
on-arrival: mf_strength *= 0.85; mf_strength *= 0.7 if guardia_asalto_loyalty >= 0.7; mf_banned = 1; mf_militancy -= 0.05; mf_ban_timer = 6;

With Jose Antonio detained and all the proofs we've discovered we can finally ban the Falange.

@unban_fe
view-if: mf_banned = 1
on-arrival: mf_banned = 0; mf_strength += 100; mf_militancy += 0.05

The Falange Española is no longer banned. They immediately go on a recruiting spree.

@persecute_fe
title: Persecute the Falange.
choose-if: judicial_reform >= 3 and guardia_asalto_loyalty >= 0.7
unavailable-subtitle: [? if judicial_reform < 3 : The judiciary would not allow this. ?] [? if interior_police_loyalty < 0.7 : The police are too disloyal to be trusted with this. ?]
on-arrival: mf_strength *= 0.7; mf_militancy -= 0.05; fe_persecuted += 1

We have arrested more of the Falange Española's leaders and confiscated their weapons. 

@ban_rc
on-arrival: rc_strength *= 0.85; rc_strength *= 0.7 if guardia_civil_loyalty >= 0.7; rc_banned = 1;
view-if: rc_banned == 0 and carlist_persecuted >= 1

Due to its armed paramilitary, the Requetés, we've banned the Comunión Carlista. However, they keep working underground.

@unban_rc
view-if: rc_banned = 1
on-arrival: rc_banned = 0; rc_strength += 100

The Comunión Carlista is no longer banned. New adept carlist join their ranks. 

@persecute_rc
title: Persecute the Carlists.
choose-if: judicial_reform >= 3 and guardia_civil_loyalty >= 0.7
unavailable-subtitle: [? if judicial_reform < 3 : The judiciary would not allow this. ?] [? if guardia_civil_loyalty < 0.7 : The Guardia Civil are too disloyal to be trusted with this. ?]
on-arrival: rc_strength *= 0.7; rc_militancy -= 0.05; guardia_civil_loyalty -= 0.1; carlist_persecuted += 1

We have arrested more of the Comunión Carlista's leaders and confiscated their weapons.


@ban_pce
view-if: communist_coalition < 3 and pce_banned = 0 and pce_persecuted >= 1
on-arrival: pce_relation -= 15; pce_strength -= 50; mc_banned = 1; communist_coalition -= 1; prr_relation += 5; prrs_relation += 5; ar_relation += 5; guardia_civil_loyalty += 0.1; guardia_asalto_loyalty += 0.1; pce_coalition_dissent += 5;

The ban is enthusiastically carried out by the police, perhaps too enthusiastically. The Communists take this as one more reason why the Socialists are traitors to the left. However, the moderate and center-right parties approve, as do the police.

@unban_pce
view-if: mc_banned = 1
on-arrival: mc_banned = 0; pce_relation += 5; mc_strength += 50; guardia_civil_loyalty -= 0.05

The Communist PCE is no longer banned.

@persecute_pce
title: Persecute the PCE.
on-arrival: mc_strength *= 0.7; mc_militancy -= 0.05; pce_relation -= 10; pce_coalition_dissent += 3; pce_persecuted += 1

We have arrested more of the PCE's leaders and confiscated their weapons.


@ban_cnt
view-if: ma_banned = 0 and cnt_persecuted >= 1
on-arrival: ma_strength -= 50; ma_banned = 1; ma_militancy += 0.2; prr_relation += 5; prrs_relation += 5; ar_relation += 5; guardia_civil_loyalty += 0.1; guardia_asalto_loyalty += 0.1; cnt_militancy -= 2; cnt_relation -= 50 if psoe_in_government == 1;

The ban is enthusiastically carried out by the Guardia Civil, perhaps too enthusiastically. The Anarchists take this as one more reason why the Socialists are traitors to the working class. However, the moderate and center-right parties approve, as do the police.

However, the anarchists are used to work outside the legality, so they keep operating underground and become even more violent. 

@unban_cnt
view-if: ma_banned = 1
on-arrival: ma_banned = 0; cnt_militancy += 2;

The Anarchist CNT is no longer banned.

@persecute_cnt
title: Persecute the CNT.
view-if: guardia_civil_loyalty >= 0.5
on-arrival: ma_strength *= 0.7; ma_militancy -= 0.05; cnt_militancy -= 1; cnt_persecuted += 1; cnt_relation -= 15;

We have arrested more of the CNT's leaders and confiscated their weapons.
